---
subject: "{{ code }} is your PropFlow reset code"
preheader: "Your code is {{ code }}. It works for {{ minutes }} minutes."
---
{%- comment -%}
  Forgot password: the 6-digit code.
  Data: name, code, minutes, ip, requested_at, google_only (signs in with Google, no password yet)
{%- endcomment -%}
{% layout "email" %}
{% block content %}
<h1 style="margin:0 0 20px;{{ style.h1 }}">{% if google_only %}Set a password{% else %}Reset your password{% endif %}</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;{{ style.p }}">Hi {{ name | first_name }},</p>
{%- if google_only %}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;{{ style.p }}">You usually sign in with Google, so you can keep using <strong>Continue with Google</strong>. To add a password as well, enter this code when asked:</p>
{%- else %}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;{{ style.p }}">Enter this code on the reset page to choose a new password:</p>
{%- endif %}
{% render "code", code: code %}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;{{ style.small }}">The code works for {{ minutes }} minutes. To protect your account, don't share it with anyone, including PropFlow staff.</p>
{% capture note %}This code was requested from <strong style="color:{{ color.ink }};">{{ ip | default: "an unknown address" }}</strong> at <strong style="color:{{ color.ink }};">{{ requested_at | pkt_time }}</strong>. If it wasn't you, you can safely ignore this email; your password hasn't changed.{% endcapture %}
{% render "security", body: note %}
{% endblock %}
